  "Kenteken, voertuig en de vervaldatum die de aanleiding is.": "Registration, vehicle and the expiry date that is the trigger.",
  "Ketens die alles centraal willen aansturen vanuit één systeem": "Chains that want to steer everything centrally from one system",
  "Keuring": "Inspection",
  "Keuring inplannen": "Schedule the inspection",
